<h1 id="hero-title">Thoughtful websites, made with care.</h1>
<p class="hero-intro">I’m Ajay — learning, designing and building for the web, one considered detail at a time.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button-link" href="#work">Explore selected work</a><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Get in touch</a></div></div>
